{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"computing as phenomena surrounding computers computing as phenomena surrounding computers","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md","fileName":"Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 20:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Computer Science as a Discipline]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Computer Science as a Discipline","computationalthinking.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"computing as phenomena surrounding computers computing as phenomena surrounding computers","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md","fileName":"Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers","heading":"Computing as Phenomena Surrounding Computers","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An early justification for computer science held that wherever there are rich phenomena, there can be a science that describes and explains them. Computers and the systems around them produced new empirical behavior worthy of study.\n\nThis view answered the objection that a human-made artifact could not support a science. Time-sharing systems, for example, had to be built and observed before reliable theories of their performance could emerge.","tags":["baby"],"lin